% sgchem_cr_zero_before_first_star: dense clump (n_H = 1e6 cm^-3) in a 16 pc box, units kpc, 1e10 Msun, km/s; see the test
InitCondFile                sgchem_cr_zero_before_first_star_ics
OutputDir                   output
ICFormat                    3
SnapFormat                  3
NumFilesPerSnapshot         2                 % one file per rank (2 ranks): the test reads every rank's cells
TimeBegin                   0
TimeMax                     3.0e-5            % 29 kyr, 0.7 free-fall times of the clump
BoxSize                     0.016
TimeOfFirstSnapshot         0
TimeBetSnapshot             1.25e-6           % = MaxSizeTimestep: between two snapshots every cell goes through the chemistry
TimeBetStatistics           1.25e-6
MaxSizeTimestep             1.25e-6
MinSizeTimestep             1e-12
DesNumNgb                   32
MaxNumNgbDeviation          0.1
UnitLength_in_cm            3.085678e21
UnitMass_in_g               1.989e43
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s    1.0e5
UnitMagneticField_in_gauss  1.0
InitGasTemp                 0
InitMetallicity             1.0
InitStellarAge              10.0              % the star of the ic_star case: 10 Gyr old
MinGasTemp                  10
CritPhysDensity             1.5e6             % above the initial clump density: the first star forms during the collapse
SfEffPerFreeFall            0.5
FacSfThreshMJ               1.0
StellarTablesFile           SET_BY_TEST
SGChemTablesPath            SET_BY_TEST
SGChemCosmicRayIonRate      3.0e-19           % as the zoom [s^-1]
SGChemDustToGasRatio        1.0
SGChemDeuteriumAbundance    2.6e-5
SGChemG0                    1.7
SGChemG0_LW                 0
TreeColShieldingLength      0.050
PhotoionMaxSearchRadius     0.05
SofteningGas                1.0e-4
MinGasKernelRadiusFractional 0
SofteningHalo               0.050
SofteningDisk               0.020
SofteningBulge              0.020
SofteningStars              1.0e-4
SofteningBndry              0.005
BiniX                       0
BiniY                       0
BiniZ                       2.0e-6
AGS_DesNumNgb               32
MaxKernelRadius             2000
IMFSampleMinMass            0.08
IMFSampleStellarMassCut     0.5
SFCooldownFreeFallFraction  0.1
MaxStellarTimestep          10000.0
